    "towerM": 22,
    "text": {
      "en": "KNMI's southern radar sits on a former air traffic control radar tower in the village of Herwijnen, in the river land between the Waal and the Linge. It replaced the radar on KNMI's tower in De Bilt, whose view was blocked by new high-rise buildings, and was officially opened on 12 May 2017."
